# Frontend UI

- Import design language from `app/ds.css` (via `globals.css`). Prefer classes: `page`, `metric-card`, `action-card`, `panel`, `list-row`, `btn-primary|secondary|ghost`, `t-h1|h2|h3|body|body-sm|caption`, `field`, `nav-link`.
- Shell: `components/layout/studio-shell.tsx` — do not add a second nav in page content.
- One `--accent` filled button per screen. Featured action card uses 2px accent border, not a second primary fill unless the top bar has no CTA.
- Keep resume sheet CSS (`.resume-print`, template families) intact when editing `globals.css`.
- After UI changes: `docker compose up -d --build`.
